---
import BenchmarkChart from './BenchmarkChart.astro';
import { benchmark, benchmarkScopes, astraComparison } from '../data/benchmark';
---

<div class="benchmark-content">
  <h3>Zero-Shot Robotic Manipulation Evaluation</h3>
  <p>
    We evaluate 132 tasks from LIBERO, RoboTwin, and RoboDojo under a <strong>zero-shot</strong> protocol
    with native success criteria. Control-step budgets are unchanged except for RoboDojo, increased to
    1,875 steps per episode. Following
    <a href="https://huggingface.co/benchmend">BenchMend</a>,
    we rewrite task instructions to make hidden criteria explicit, such as parking the arm at its home position.
  </p>
  <p>
    For GPT-6-Astra (high effort), we compare Codex with the
    <strong>benchmark-native action API</strong>, with the <strong>device abstraction</strong>,
    and <strong>Kinex</strong>. Kinex raises success from {astraComparison.baselineSuccessRate.toFixed(1)}%
    to <strong>{astraComparison.kinexSuccessRate.toFixed(1)}%</strong> at
    <strong>{astraComparison.costReductionPercent.toFixed(1)}% lower cost</strong>
    than Codex + Bare action API.
    See the <a href={benchmark.source}>Hugging Face release</a>
    for evaluation details, demos, and agent traces.
  </p>
  <fieldset class="scope-picker">
    <legend class="sr-only">Choose benchmark results</legend>
    {benchmarkScopes.map((scope) => (
      <label>
        <input class="sr-only" type="radio" name="benchmark-scope" value={scope.id} checked={scope.id === 'average'} />
        <span>{scope.label}</span>
      </label>
    ))}
  </fieldset>
  <div class="scope-summary" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
    {benchmarkScopes.map((scope) => (
      <p data-scope-panel={scope.id} hidden={scope.id !== 'average'}>
        {scope.id === 'average' ? 'All benchmarks' : scope.label} · {scope.tasks} tasks per setup
      </p>
    ))}
  </div>
  <section class="model" aria-labelledby="astra-heading">
    <header><h3 id="astra-heading">GPT-6-Astra</h3><span>Codex · high effort</span></header>
    <div class="chart-grid">
      <BenchmarkChart metric="success" />
      <BenchmarkChart metric="cost" />
    </div>
  </section>
  <p class="chart-note">
    Average weights all 132 tasks equally. Success rate is successful tasks / evaluated tasks;
    cost is the mean API-equivalent estimate in USD per task, including successful and failed episodes.
  </p>
  <div class="source-links">
    <a href={benchmark.source}>Evaluation details, demos, and agent traces</a>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.benchmark-content').forEach((section) => {
    section.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="benchmark-scope"]').forEach((input) => {
      input.addEventListener('change', () => {
        if (!input.checked) return;
        section.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-scope-panel]').forEach((panel) => {
          panel.hidden = panel.dataset.scopePanel !== input.value;
        });
      });
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .benchmark-content { margin-top: 16px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: var(--fs-4); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  p { color: var(--ink-2); margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.75; }
  strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .scope-picker { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 28px 0 8px; padding: 0; border: 0; }
  .scope-picker label { cursor: pointer; }
  .scope-picker span { display: block; padding: 6px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 4px; font-size: var(--fs-1); background: var(--panel); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .scope-picker input:checked + span { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-bg); color: var(--accent-ink); }
  .scope-picker input:focus-visible + span { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .scope-picker label:hover span { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .scope-summary p { margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-1); }
  .model { min-width: 0; margin-top: 20px; }
  .chart-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 28px; margin-top: 16px; }
  header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-bottom: 14px; }
  header h3 { font-size: var(--fs-3); margin: 0 0 4px; }
  header span { color: var(--ink-2); font-size: var(--fs-1); }
  .chart-note { margin: 20px 0 12px; font-size: var(--fs-1); }
  .source-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; font-size: var(--fs-1); }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .chart-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 20px; } }
</style>
